 switchport trunk vlan-allowed 1237
 switchport trunk vlan-untagged 1237
 switchport pvid 1237
 speed 100

interface GigaEthernet0/14
 switchport trunk vlan-allowed 1238
 switchport trunk vlan-untagged 1238
 switchport pvid 1238
 speed 100

interface GigaEthernet0/15
 switchport trunk vlan-allowed 1239
 switchport trunk vlan-untagged 1239
 switchport pvid 1239
